MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The newer Echo Dot feels like a useful next step because voice control would complement the Fire TV devices I already use.",
    "The Blink Video Doorbell fits my security interests while adding front-door alerts and two-way communication alongside my existing cameras."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; a related device needs to offer a useful new capability.",
    "The AirPods and USB cable do not address a current need. The hard drive could help with camcorder videos, but I would wait until storage becomes a problem."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Alexa-compatible devices seems to have led to several speaker suggestions, although I would choose one newer Echo Dot before considering more speakers.",
    "My camera purchases seem to be treated as a reason to buy more camera equipment, even when a whole-home bundle overlaps with what I already own."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: I am more interested in adding a useful capability than duplicating my streaming and security equipment.",
    "Compatibility alone does not make me ready to buy. I need a specific use for a smart plug, cable, or extra storage before choosing it."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my home entertainment and security interests but gave too little weight to existing equipment and whether an addition solves a current need."
}
